<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS1" title="In Appendix D Limitations and Additional Discussion ‣ Implicit Variational Rejection Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.1 </span>Robustness of the Method in High-Dimensional Settings</span></a></li>
