<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F2.sf3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(c)</span> </span><span id="S4.F2.sf3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> IVRS (ours)</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 2</span>: </span><span id="S4.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Examples of 16 MNIST images from the test set using the VAE learned by AVB and IVRS. Our method generates images with a closer resemblance to the ground truth compared to the baseline due to the rejection sampling.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
